<title>USA: Stage Stores unit prices tender offers.</title>
<headline>Stage Stores unit prices tender offers.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Stage Stores Inc said on Tuesday that its wholly owned subsidiary, Specialty Retailers Inc, priced its tender offer for its 10 percent senior notes due 2000 at $1,056.03 for each $1,000 principal amount, with a payment date of June 17.</p>
<p>The purchase price for the company's 11 percent Series B senior subordinated notes due 2003 will be $1,098.39, also with a payment date of June 17, the company said in a news release.</p>
<p>The tender offers expire June 13.</p>
</text>
